  "id": "satisfaction-with-life-scale",
  "term": "Satisfaction With Life Scale",
  "definition": "The Satisfaction With Life Scale is a widely used five-item self-report measure of subjective well-being that asks people for an overall judgment of how satisfied they are with their lives. Evidence in the source indicates it mainly reflects a single life-satisfaction dimension and is broadly comparable across many countries, languages, genders, and age groups.",
